    "title": "Is today Good Friday 2026? When is Easter 2026?",
    "text": "NEWSIs today, April 3, Good Friday 2026? When is Easter 2026?Travis Jacque Rose Joyce OrlandoUSA TODAY NETWORKApril 3, 2026, 9:41 a.m. ETGood Friday, which takes place a couple of days before Easter, is upon us.The Christian holy day of Good Friday commemorates Jesus Christ's sacrifice, specifically the suffering he faced leading up to his Crucifixion. Easter commemorates Jesus Christ's resurrection in Jerusalem and is celebrated by Christians as the foundation of their faith.\"Good Friday has been, for centuries now, the heart of the Christian message because it is through the death of Jesus Christ that Christians believe that we have been forgiven of our sins,\" Daniel Alvarez, an associate teaching professor of religious studies at Florida International University, previously told USA TODAY.",
